            </note>
            <note corresp="#d79-f4" n="76" xml:id="d79-f4-content">
                <p>General of the Army Henry H. Arnold.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d79-f5" n="77" xml:id="d79-f5-content">
                <p>Information concerning the furnishing of maintenance items in return for cash
                    payment was communicated in a note from the Secretary of State to the British
                    Ambassador on October 12, not printed. For text of note sent, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">mutatis mutandis</hi>, on the same date to the Soviet
                    Chargé, see <ref target="frus1945v05#pg_1042">vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >v</hi>, p. 1042</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
